"instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Talk about social and environmental changes that have been occurring in your country."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le15ob10re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le15ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le15ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le15ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "Although efforts are being made to change the perception, mathematics and computer programming have typically been seen as male disciplines. This impression might not have become so prevalent if more people knew that the first programmer may have been a woman.", "id": 1}, {"time": "15500", "image": "engenn9le15ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "Augusta Ada King, Countess of Lovelace, was born on December 10, 1815. From an early age, she displayed a keen interest in mathematics and logic. Her mathematical talents led her to collaborate with Charles Babbage, who was a philosopher, inventor and mechanical engineer. He created plans for an \u201cAnalytical Engine\u201d (a type of computer), and her notes on the proposal include what has been recognised as the first algorithm intended to be carried out by a machine. As a result, she has been credited with writing the first computer program, and with increasing frequency she is referred to as the first computer programmer. It must have been quite difficult for her, working in such a male-dominated society, and rumor of scandal due to her relaxed relationship with men persisted throughout her life.", "id": 2}, {"time": "68000", "image": "engenn9le15ob10re2img03.jpg", "text": "Nowadays, more and more women are entering computer science and math, and groups such as \u201cWomen in Mathematics\u201d and \u201cWomen in Computing\u201d are being founded by student organizations. The advent of these groups, along with the trail that was blazed by women such as Ada Lovelace, could have been responsible for the increase in female enrolment that is currently being experienced by universities around the world.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Biographies"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Ada Lovelace"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 15}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe social, urban, and environmental change in social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le15ob10re1img01.jpg  "}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "discipline"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a branch of knowledge studied at a college or university"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Mathematics and computer programming have typically been seen as male disciplines."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs and fame."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "programmer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who writes computer programs"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The first programmer may have been a woman."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to collaborate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to work together on an activity"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Her mathematical talents led her to collaborate with Charles Babbage. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "philosopher"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who studies the nature of reality and existence"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Socrates was a Greek philosopher."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inventor"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who creates new devices as an occupation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Thomas Edison was a famous American inventor."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mechanical engineer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an engineer who works with mechanical systems "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They called a mechanical engineer to fix the engine."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rumor"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a story which is uncertain or untrue"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There were many rumors about her relationships."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scandal"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "public outrage caused by an illegal or immoral action"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She always seemed to be at the center of some sort of scandal."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I create a chart comparing social and environmental change in my country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use sentences in the passive voice."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my thoughts with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I provide and receive feedback on my ideas about social and environmental change."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Create a chart with two columns. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Add the headings \u201csocial change\u201d and \u201cenvironmental change.\u201d"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write at least 5 examples in each column. (e.g. <span class=\"italic\">Many employees are being replaced by robots.</span>)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare your chart with a partner's."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Passive: The Present Continuous and Present Perfect Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Continuous to talk about an action that is happening at the time of speaking. The action or event is in progress.  </br><span class=\"italic\">Student organizations <span class=\"strong\">are founding</span> groups such as \u201cWomen in Mathematics\u201d and \u201cWomen in Computing\u201d.  </span></br></br>You use the Present Perfect to talk about a finished action or event with present consequences. There is a connection between what happened in the past and the present.</br><span class=\"italic\"> People <span class=\"strong\">have</span> typically<span class=\"strong\"> seen</span> mathematics and computer programming as male disciplines.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You often choose the passive form when you want to talk about an action but are not so interested in saying who or what does/did it. Passives without <span class=\"italic\">agents</span> (the doers) are common in academic and scientific writing. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart below for the structure of the passive voice."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"am/are/is +  being + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Groups such as \u201cWomen in Mathematics\u201d and \u201cWomen in Computing\u201d <span class=\\\"strong\\\">are being founded</span> by student organizations.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have/has + been + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Mathematics and computer programming <span class=\\\"strong\\\">have</span> typically<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> been seen</span> as male disciplines. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Although efforts are being made to change the perception, mathematics and computer programming have typically been seen as male disciplines. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "She created plans for an \u201cAnalytical Engine\u201d (a type of computer), and her notes on the proposal include what has been recognized as the first algorithm intended to be carried out by a machine. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "As a result, she has been credited with writing the first computer program, and with increasing frequency she is referred to as the first computer programmer."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Nowadays, more and more women are entering computer science and math, and groups such as \u201cWomen in Mathematics\u201d and \u201cWomen in Computing\u201d are being founded by student organizations. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Speculation About the Past"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use modals to talk about degrees of certainty and speculate about things in the past. </br>You use them to describe what is definite, probable, possible, or impossible from the speaker's point of view. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">must</span>, <span class=\"italic\">may</span>, <span class=\"italic\">might</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to describe degrees of certainty. </br>You can use modals with the Present Perfect to talk about the possibility of a past event that is not clear in the present context."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">This impression <span class=\"strong\">might not have become</span> so prevalent if more people knew that the first programmer <span class=\"strong\">may have been</span> a woman.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart for the meanings of modals when speculating about the past:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Modal Phrase </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Must have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is very likely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"May have </br>Might have </br>Could have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is possible \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">May have</span> has a slightly stronger meaning that <span class=\"italic\">might have</span> or<span class=\"italic\"> could have</span>.</li><li>You can add <span class=\"strong\">not </span>to make a negative speculation (It <span class=\"strong\">may not have been</span> true).</li></ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It must have been quite difficult for her, working in such a male-dominated society, and rumor of scandal due to her relaxed relationship with men persisted throughout her life."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The advent of these groups, along with the trail that was blazed by women such as Ada Lovelace, could have been responsible for the increase in female enrolment that is currently being experienced by universities around the world. "}]}]}